{"version":"https://jsonfeed.org/version/1.1","title":"肾虚大吐 - 标签","description":"Hugo FixIt 作者，喜欢瞎折腾、造轮子、写东西，分享一些前端开发中的所见、所闻、所思。","home_page_url":"https://lruihao.cn/","language":"zh-CN","icon":"https://lruihao.cn/apple-touch-icon.png","favicon":"https://lruihao.cn/favicon.ico","authors":[{"name":"Acuherb","url":"https://acuherb.xyz/","avatar":"https://acuherb.xyz/images/avatar.png"}],"items":[{"title":"逆医法：论气喘上逆 论双蛾 论肾虚大吐","date_published":"2026-04-21T10:04:52&#43;08:00","date_modified":"2026-04-21T10:08:52&#43;08:00","id":"https://lruihao.cn/posts/1-4-niyifa/","url":"https://lruihao.cn/posts/1-4-niyifa/","authors":[{"name":"Acuherb","url":"https://acuherb.xyz/","avatar":"https://gravatar.loli.net/avatar/89719985bb81a6f9d508808413f1b999?s=32&amp;d=mp"}],"tags":["气喘上逆","双蛾","肾虚大吐"],"summary":"本节为《石室秘录》“逆医法”部分，论述气喘上逆、双蛾（喉痹）、肾虚大吐三证。核心思想是针对假热真寒、上盛下虚之逆证，不治标而治本，逆其病势而用药，故称“逆医法”。","content_html":"本节为《石室秘录》“逆医法”部分，论述\u003cstrong\u003e气喘上逆、双蛾（喉痹）、肾虚大吐\u003c/strong\u003e三证。核心思想是\u003cstrong\u003e针对假热真寒、上盛下虚之逆证，不治标而治本，逆其病势而用药\u003c/strong\u003e，故称“逆医法”。"}]}